sequenceDiagram
    participant Sync as Sync (Ch 32)
    participant Room as SSOT (Ch 3)
    participant WM as WidgetUpdateWorker (Ch 30)
    participant Glance as Glance widget
    participant Launcher as Home screen

    Sync->>Room: upsert latest order status
    Room-->>WM: data changed -> enqueue widget update (expedited if urgent, Ch 47)
    WM->>Room: read snapshot (active account, Ch 42)
    WM->>Glance: updateAppWidgetState + update()
    Glance->>Launcher: push new RemoteViews
